<div style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;">Care Instructions</div>
<div style="color: #4b5563;">Basics for every piece: <strong>blot, don&rsquo;t scrub</strong> &bull; <strong>test cleaners on a hidden spot first</strong> &bull; <strong>keep away from direct sun and heat vents</strong>.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6px;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td width="34%" valign="top" style="padding: 4px 4px 4px 0;">
<div class="fd-card" style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px;">
<h3>FABRIC / UPHOLSTERY</h3>
<div style="font-size: 11px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 4px;">Check the cleaning code on the tag (often under cushions):</div>
<ul>
<li><strong>W</strong> &ndash; water-based cleaner only</li>
<li><strong>S</strong> &ndash; solvent-based only, <strong>no water</strong></li>
<li><strong>WS / SW</strong> &ndash; water or solvent</li>
<li><strong>X</strong> &ndash; vacuum / brush only</li>
<li>Vacuum weekly; rotate cushions if reversible</li>
<li>Blot spills right away; no bleach or ammonia</li>
</ul>
</div>
</td>
<td width="33%" valign="top" style="padding: 4px;">
<div class="fd-card" style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px;">
<h3>LEATHER</h3>
<ul>
<li>Dust weekly with a dry microfiber cloth</li>
<li>Vacuum seams gently with a crevice tool</li>
<li>Condition every <strong>6&ndash;12 months</strong> to prevent drying and cracking</li>
<li>Wipe spills immediately with a clean, absorbent cloth</li>
<li>No soap, harsh detergents, saddle soap or oily cleaners</li>
<li>Keep 2&ndash;3 ft from heat sources and out of direct sun</li>
<li>Keep sharp objects off leather</li>
</ul>
</div>
</td>
<td width="33%" valign="top" style="padding: 4px 0 4px 4px;">
<div class="fd-card" style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px;">
<h3>WOOD / VENEER</h3>
<ul>
<li>Dust with a soft, dry cloth</li>
<li>Wipe with the grain using a slightly damp cloth, then dry immediately</li>
<li>Use coasters and placemats to prevent rings and heat marks</li>
<li>Avoid extreme dryness or dampness; small seasonal movement is normal</li>
</ul>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
